      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "By my understanding, this has been an issue ever since constraints were whitelisted to be used on avatars. It pre-dates VRChat constraints and is an inherited problem.\n\nThe non-converted avatar avtr_c32b6dbf-e8f8-46a4-a338-4828d68e307e appears to exhibit this same issue in live. As you've claimed that it works correctly on live, can you please confirm? Make sure that there are no mirrors active at all when testing, including your personal and face mirrors.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
